  "notes": {
    "design_rationale": "This config balances realism and trainability: more debris dynamics and probabilistic collision screening than the original, but conservative physics and episode length to keep training stable. Start training with these settings; if early learning is slow, reduce num_parallel_envs, shorten simulation_duration_seconds, or temporarily disable uncertainty features while the agent learns basic avoidance."
